{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "a77a9dd882284a370cb160d039ae4f38ba6051dc5735ecf0610fa6d881ab4a80", "ja": "スターティング・ハイッ", "zh": "Starting High", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2a971eff947a7d7cc0330769abfd0732b23e799901eee3f1cdb0d6c507eb3f8d", "ja": "奈緒の提案した『真夏のリレー走』は、ライ\nブ会場までメンバー達でリレーをし、客席を\n盛り上げようというものだった。話を聞いて\n興味を持った莉緒、エレナと一緒に、一同は\nランニングで体力作りをすることに。", "zh": "奈绪提议的『盛夏大队接力』，内容是\n成员们以接力方式跑到演唱会会场，\n来带动观众席的气氛。莉绪和艾琳娜\n听了这件事很感兴趣，也一起加入，\n一行人便决定用跑步来锻炼体力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cacdda1de40344f4be8a694f59c839c764c06673f0d0ef09088da529129ecd98", "ja": "（天体公演の説明をしたら、奈緒がすごいやる気を\n示してくれた。それはとても嬉しいんだけど……）", "zh": "（说明了天体公演后，奈绪表现出十足的干劲。\n这点让我很高兴，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "de1c3b33a1934ab9943dec510e112849142c038659c2e5190087178bcc90c685", "ja": "奈緒。劇場を走り抜ける、真夏のリレー走……\nというのは？", "zh": "奈绪，你说绕着剧场跑一圈的盛夏大队接力……\n那是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "d63c59db601066c7844ee7bb701699d5e6aed0d2bd1c123f2cb3df0171f909d5", "ja": "よくぞ聞いてくれました！　やっぱり、\n私の考える真夏のリレー走に興味あるんですね？", "zh": "问得好！\n你果然对我想到的盛夏大队接力很有兴趣吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "290de3f66dd0de3d330916ada777972eb387710be648c57344f723586ff4faea", "ja": "ええと、うん。そうだな。\n出来るだけ詳しく説明してほしい。", "zh": "这个嘛，嗯，对啊，\n希望你尽可能说明得详细一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "f5974d924ad3f5765fe48f47c7ab018dc3bef99e04efeebb11ec5d1b94b18df6", "ja": "はいっ！　私、今度のライブの前に、ここにおる\n3人で、リレー走をしたいなーって思ってるんです！", "zh": "好的！其实我想要在这次的演唱会之前，\n由在场这三个人进行大队接力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "6e2b6adb49113bf42d6538d15bbc7c196ac6784b248d57e37989ec67642b5b2f", "ja": "今回の曲ってランニングがテーマですよね？　やから、\nランニングに絡めて新しいこと出来ひんかなって。", "zh": "这次的歌曲主题是跑步对吧？\n所以我在想，说不定可以做些跟跑步有关的新尝试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d616c1272066f5f217a9b8c95c60bf8e89e4be09a12b803fd37c5e67b1d2b391", "ja": "リレー走をした後にライブか……試みは面白いかな。\n走る姿を中継すれば、客席との連帯感も出るし。", "zh": "先跑大队接力再举办演唱会啊……概念挺有意思的。\n而且转播跑步的样子，也能和观众产生团结感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b265e6fb78c49a3f684d366377593ee092f1b07edc03bb4a2e237facf673634d", "ja": "ただ、リレー走となると体力作りが必須になるぞ？\nレッスンもあるから、なかなかハードだけど……。", "zh": "只是，必须锻炼好体力才能进行大队接力喔。\n你们还有训练要做，这会非常辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "fbf0b10770c0f03a8196aa9714d69b0fa7d3c2ae5f6ec0bd74ef3c209f98a860", "ja": "そこなんです！　真夏やし、無謀なんもわかってます。\nけど{$P$}さんも言うたとおり……。", "zh": "重点就是这个！毕竟是盛夏，我也知道这很乱来。\n不过就像{$P$}先生说的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "67c792ba1491b4b7c63c1685a133f001e743054620d486ce16765adac066f568", "ja": "お客さん、めっちゃ盛り上がるんちゃうかなって\n私なりに考えてみたんですけど……ど、どうですか！？", "zh": "现场观众的气氛应该会超级热烈。\n这是我自己试着思考的结果……怎、怎么样呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "771eea5f1f47656c2812fa21ea731023752ede5e4341721553eb7cc517c38272", "ja": "そっかぁ。奈緒さんは、今回の公演で\n新しいことをしたかったんだねぇ。", "zh": "原来如此，\n奈绪想要在这次的公演做点新的尝试哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "a09340a1e305146875127c1e48c0352b241fe76fa707d797af3ad08265ca286b", "ja": "天体公演に向けての新しい挑戦……\n素敵な思いつきだと思います、奈緒さん！", "zh": "天体公演的新挑战……\n我觉得这个想法很棒，奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5925f2884a467f86ed1913beaa0be684afacac44534fbef01d5e5033fb851dd9", "ja": "確かに、体力は全ての基本だからな。この機会に\nきちんと向き合っておくのは、悪くないと思う。", "zh": "有道理，毕竟体力是一切的基础。\n藉这个机会认真锻炼一下也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "26ec101be82a01e39f8859b4b39dfd7d0e93c740717a47dffec798cf3ed33610", "ja": "あたしも、いいと思うよぉ。東京に来てから、\n思いっきり走ることもなかったし。", "zh": "我也觉得这个主意很好哪。\n自从来到东京后，我就没有尽情跑过步了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "6a1aaeaccc751ebdf12aaf1db379947f4a1123c9cb487f639ff620709984c778", "ja": "私も挑戦したいのですが、体力には自信がなく……\nおふたりの足を、引っ張ってしまうかも……。", "zh": "我也很想挑战，但我对自己的体力没信心……\n或许会扯两位的后腿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "6723b9da5b77f9efed8ac2f0a5ff92bada222afca9cca8981b542cc9e0100fa6", "ja": "エミリーちゃんなら、大丈夫だよぉ。\n頑張り屋さんだしねぇ。ゆっくりでいいっしょや。", "zh": "艾蜜莉没问题的，\n毕竟你是个很努力的人，慢慢来就可以了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "6e6027145b5484ae611f7b5f9017fc07812c470ccf0879a9c1ed2559f77b8f78", "ja": "せやな、誰かと競争するわけちゃうしな。\n3人で楽しくできたらええと思うわ♪", "zh": "就是呀，反正又不是要跟谁赛跑。\n我们三个人能开心就好啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "45c02709dc1eda4ae3dcca6f085fefda3f28643b6946e15cf76e5cb0a76a7277", "ja": "ひなたさん、奈緒さん……そうですよね！\n私もこれを機会に、体力作りに励みたいと思います♪", "zh": "日向、奈绪……你们说得对！\n我也想趁这个机会好好锻炼体力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "08b15fa758882906a9e8bce7bf4521f368476b827b868c6c0c5b0f97728fa28e", "ja": "自らの弱点に、あえて立ち向かうこと……\n立派な大和撫子になるには、大切なことです！", "zh": "勇于面对自己的弱点……\n如果要成为优秀的大和抚子，这是很重要的一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0cedb82a9439efd3709c8f8fed9f0c25c688a15ccd4fc0f21fc236148ce30bc5", "ja": "話はまとまったな。天体公演、そしてライブ直前の\n真夏のリレー走、両方の準備を進めることにして……。", "zh": "看来有结论了，天体公演及演唱会前的盛夏大队接力，\n接下来就是得准备这两件事，然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "faff9438135e5e702a10e4e7f95973bf8489514a5885dfa6c1a0b1795603a946", "ja": "今日はみんなで下見だな。コースは俺が考えるから、\nそれに沿って劇場周辺を歩いてみよう。", "zh": "今天大家一起去场勘吧。\n路线我来想，大家先沿着走走看剧场周围吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1024_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "12804f0226086243edf64dc320350e1eaed41edf757570d34cc579195e0e302a", "ja": "日本の夏は、本当にすごい熱気と湿気ですね……。\nこれに耐えてこそ、大和撫子……！", "zh": "日本的夏天真的好湿热呢……\n得撑过这些，才能算是大和抚子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "f324a5d5936cb3f1ba5fff6fbecf23865b3c8e224b1e37f75ee4171eb479d0e5", "ja": "いや、耐えたらあかんで！　ほんまに！\nさっきの私みたいに、へろへろになってまうから。", "zh": "不是，不可以硬撑啦！我说真的！\n不然会跟我刚才一样虚脱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "da7e81630bd0aa68ad6f154f76a786f1958b5496e2f81ceeaee37faa8ee8dffa", "ja": "こんだけのカンカン照りだもの。こまめに水を\n飲まないと、作物も人間も干からびちゃうからねぇ。", "zh": "外面太阳这么毒辣，不经常多喝水的话，\n不管作物还是人类都会干枯的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "13d9ad119a258f0f550db3e807240ee2e903dbd26bf83834f1b9de82dad1c67f", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。みんな、熱中症には気をつけよう。\n……ん？　あっちから歩いてくるのは……。", "zh": "嗯，就是啊，大家小心不要中暑了。\n……嗯？从那边走过来的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "24953bfdf53dc97ece467fbf75c730e7a14f6d944a7ddf3de0ac1b87d0cffcf8", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nみんな一緒なんだネ、こんにちはっ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n大家都在一起呢，午安♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "9a2a814631c11b46578d4080c4d49c028dfd178d297f4b53137884e4358de4a1", "ja": "エレナちゃんと、そこで偶然会ったの♪\nみんなは？　どこか出かけるの？", "zh": "我是在那边碰巧遇到艾琳娜的♪\n大家呢？是要出门去哪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "9ecf56eb4bc8f1364b6d6001332c7dd7208a0359fe2649f577903b910f9fc059", "ja": "エレナ、莉緒、お疲れさま。\n実は、今度の天体公演で……。", "zh": "艾琳娜、莉绪，你们辛苦了。\n其实这次的天体公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_02_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "6c72b4bca231220f3321851958a4b40fa8be64a72b5125bdeb878a939305ab33", "ja": "劇場の周りをランニング！？\nそれ、すっごく楽しそうだネ！", "zh": "绕着剧场跑步！？\n感觉很好玩呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
